I think polymorph should work exactly as it does now, but it should be much
harder to get it.
One way to make polymorph more difficult, would be to change it so that one charge
is used for each item you polymorphed.  So polymorphing 5 items would immediately
take 5 charges out of your wand (or your memory, if using the spell.)
Polymorphing a pile with more items than charges left should still polymorph
it all, (have to have some fun :-), but the wand should explode (or the spell
sould be forgotten) in the process to prevent abuse.
